   "updated": 1791223717387,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "customData": null,
   "text": "How we tested it (gateway bypassed, unloaded): 4 documents of ~10K tokens, one at a time.  Measured: tokens decode had to\ncompute itself (\u2264 5% to pass), decode's first token vs recomputing the document cold on b, and whether the answer matches\ndecode alone word for word.  Two transfer libraries: NIXL, then Mooncake.",
   "fontSize": 21,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "center",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "baseline": 67,
   "containerId": "how",
   "originalText": "How we tested it (gateway bypassed, unloaded): 4 documents of ~10K tokens, one at a time.  Measured: tokens decode had to\ncompute itself (\u2264 5% to pass), decode's first token vs recomputing the document cold on b, and whether the answer matches\ndecode alone word for word.  Two transfer libraries: NIXL, then Mooncake.",
   "lineHeight": 1.15
  }
